>>
Rule 1 (tensors argument of concat API must be a non-empty tuple of tensors)
{v_1 : tuple(tensor)} |= v_1.len > 0
>>
Rule 2 (dim argument of concat API must be non-negative and less than the number of dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= v_2 >= 0 ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1)
>>
Rule 3 (a tensor has more than 1 dimension)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 1
>>
Rule 4 (a tensor must have positive shape dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
